From 0685ae17c8f3316cfb0d04b5d5a7870adbf58ce8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: atomozero <bernardi.andrea@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 22:32:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 267/270] tegra_dc: HDMI output switch, a video on the whole
 HDMI screen

'hdmi_output false' in the driver settings leaves the HDMI block off
even with a screen plugged in; the status reports it.

TEGRA_DC_SET_HDMI_VIDEO shows an overlay buffer on the whole HDMI
screen, in its proportions, with filtering and the color space
conversion of window B: the mirrored panel and the cursor leave the
HDMI screen meanwhile, and come back when it is turned off.

Signed-off-by: atomozero <bernardi.andrea@gmail.com>
